; A configuration is one the moment it is written: an empty string is
; passed to the plugin like any other, and implicit_prices, which takes
; none, fails to apply.
plugin "beancount.plugins.implicit_prices" ""

2020-01-01 open Assets:I

2020-01-02 * "buy"
  Assets:I  1 HOOL {100 USD}
  Assets:I  -100 USD
